# Source recordings sitting in the project root, before conversion to 16k mono.
# Anchored to the root so it cannot reach into samples/, which is tracked: the
# tests read the converted clips there and they need to be versioned for a
# sweep to be reproducible.
#
# Left unignored, the tree listed six hundred megabytes of unreviewable binaries
# in every status, which is part of how the new samples ended up sitting
# untracked without anyone noticing.
/*.wav

# Cut fragments the cost probes make, one per length and model combination.
logs/asr_cost/
